                                                "sense_id": "3a34d828-321e-35e3-81be-e7b6358a562b",
                                                "text": "The frenzy which had unsettled the mind of the hermit was by him communicated to his hearers who, sinking into a trance, fell easy victims to the fearful visions of a disordered mind."
